  "note": "Synthetic examples of the #288 project routes, for #290's mocks. tests/test_workspace_api.py makes them from examples/model-workspace/workspace-example.yaml with a fixed clock and fixed ids, and checks that the engine still answers exactly this. Paths are placeholders; no value is a credential or a human review.",
  "enable": {
    "command": "TMODEL_HOST_TOKEN=<secret> tmodel serve --projects",
    "header": "Authorization: Bearer <the host token>, on every request",
    "host_only": "The /workspace/host/* routes take paths and refuse any request with an Origin header, so only the desktop host can call them.",
    "saving": "There is no save route: #289's saveModelChanges calls ProjectWorkspace.commit, which is save_version with no description or summary."
  },
